Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,(巨臀妹妹為哥哥重奪自信)\N(瘋狂被哥哥內射)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,喂你好 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 今天我身體不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 是的 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,打算今天休息 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.81,0:01:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.81,0:01:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:02:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,今天真的很累 練習太辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥今天不用去\N社團活動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.09,0:02:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有事去別人家了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-說會晚回 -是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼我來做晚飯吧\N你就期待吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,5 6 7 8\N1 2 3 4
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N勝利 勝利 奮鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.69,0:08:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,很沒精神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥你聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,其實我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我被選為
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一一個去比賽的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,厲害嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥你一定要來看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:08:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直都
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,運動神經都很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.89,0:09:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我反而被後輩取代了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎 哥哥別失望
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我會支持你的 不要失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼我會為你加油的 看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:10:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.40,0:10:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,勝利 哥哥加油 奮鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 打起精神了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.09,0:11:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎麼完全不精神啊 加油\N-我已經打起精神了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-絕對沒有吧 看起來都沒有\N-是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.39,0:11:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我一個人靜靜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望哥哥打不起精神
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.39,0:11:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,能做的我什麼都會做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以打起精神吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-我真的好了\N-絕對是騙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.55,0:11:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-不要拒絶我啊 -才沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.23,0:12:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-需要再跳一次嗎 -不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.70,0:12:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-我已經很精神了\N-我真的想為你做點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的不用了 你自己練習吧\N-一點都不好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要哥哥打起精神
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等 不要\N-怎麼那麼多汗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.50,0:12:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-完全沒有\N-這樣會感冒的 我給你脫掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等 -因為會感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,身上都是汗了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因為
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.10,0:13:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-你一直在做奇怪的事情\N-什麼 只是給你脫衣服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.85,0:13:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.20,0:13:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那你快點打起精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你在摸哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.20,0:13:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-這裡都變硬了\N-才沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥你難道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看著我興奮了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.47,0:14:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-不對的\N-也就是打起精神了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.63,0:14:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-這是很好的事情呢\N-那個
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼我讓你更精神一點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我來讓你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-什麼意思\N-你看著我 打起精神了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.60,0:14:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,等等啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看清楚一點 這是為了哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不用這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是很開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,都忘記掉討厭的事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.51,0:15:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-男人都喜歡看這種吧\N-那個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但我們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-是兄妹吧\N-別想太複雜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,打起精神來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我是為了讓你打起精神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有在看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.35,0:16:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-我不可以看吧\N-為什麼啊 我是為了你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不要這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-男人都喜歡這種吧\N-那是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:17:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然不討厭 但我們是兄妹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,兄妹就不能為哥哥\N做這種事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 會有精神吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,打起精神了嗎\N怎麼還好像很失落
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.73,0:17:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-哥哥 -這個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:18:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要你打起精神
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你究竟在摸哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-所以說我要給你打起精神\N-等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-打起精神啊 這樣舒服吧\N-等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-雖然是這樣\N-果然是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.29,0:18:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等\N-所以我幫你打起精神
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-你太礙事了 為什麼有這種\N-等等 真的不要脫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你在幹嘛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,支持你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-什麼支持啊 不對吧\N-所以我要支持哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行嗎 不行嗎\N-不是不行 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-被礙事 哥哥閉嘴\N-等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.61,0:19:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-你遮住幹嘛 -那是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:20:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣我不能繼續吧\N讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.09,0:20:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,比剛才
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好像
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,更大了的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.20,0:20:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-不要說這種\N-果然更興奮了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.56,0:20:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.26,0:20:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-你太囉嗦了\N-要是被媽媽發現的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:21:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-都說了會晚回來了 沒事\N-雖然是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.79,0:21:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等 等等\N-哥哥你太囉嗦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-太害羞了 -穿這種內褲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.26,0:21:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是社團活動用的\N-打起精神吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.45,0:21:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我會讓你精神起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.60,0:21:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,已經很精神了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.58,0:21:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣才會開心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.03,0:21:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.90,0:22:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.25,0:22:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.90,0:22:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,很硬了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.80,0:22:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-果然很開心吧\N-雖然很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.79,0:22:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.40,0:22:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,打起精神了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.88,0:23:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-都說了已經是精神呢\N-再精神一點
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.81,0:23:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,別這樣看
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.70,0:23:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真硬
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:24:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,果然真的不行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.10,0:24:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-還是不行 -你太囉嗦了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.70,0:24:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力 你也加油
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.31,0:24:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,別那麼深
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.30,0:25:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.40,0:25:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.20,0:25:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-精神了嗎 -已經很精神了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.40,0:26:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不要這樣摸
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.87,0:26:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,想要你變得精神
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.70,0:26:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣才會變得更精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.10,0:26:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.20,0:26:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以說
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.50,0:26:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,想要你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.00,0:26:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,變的更開心
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.40,0:26:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.70,0:26:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.40,0:26:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,都可以做哦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.51,0:27:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.45,0:27:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.20,0:27:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.90,0:27:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.79,0:27:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.90,0:27:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你要精神一點哦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.50,0:27:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-肯定很開心吧\N-不行
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.11,0:28:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,要變精神哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.67,0:28:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.00,0:28:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.90,0:28:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.60,0:28:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服的話\N就可以打起精神了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.69,0:29:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.71,0:29:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.96,0:31:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.31,0:31:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.61,0:31:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.90,0:31:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,射了 射了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.63,0:31:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,射出來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.90,0:32:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害 果然哥哥\N打起精神了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.54,0:32:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要繼續變精神哦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.25,0:32:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-我還想要繼續 -真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.40,0:32:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.35,0:32:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以看屁股嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.30,0:33:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣嗎 這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.00,0:33:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍耐不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.69,0:33:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不行的 不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.26,0:33:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.67,0:34:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.75,0:34:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,非常柔軟哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.30,0:34:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.53,0:34:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,繼續動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.06,0:35:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股很舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.08,0:35:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,抬高點
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.40,0:35:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害 我太精神了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.29,0:35:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以繼續看哦 -太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.70,0:35:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.70,0:36:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我要高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.11,0:36:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.44,0:37:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-舒服嗎 -好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.49,0:38:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了 要高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.78,0:38:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,繼續吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.20,0:38:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-好舒服 -哥哥 繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.20,0:41:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,要高潮了 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.52,0:41:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.80,0:41:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,忍耐不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.30,0:41:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-射出來吧 哥哥\N-要射了 射了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.69,0:42:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.10,0:42:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-好厲害 -舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.90,0:42:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.56,0:42:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.25,0:42:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-哥哥可以繼續嗎 -繼續嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.73,0:42:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥 喜歡屁股對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.10,0:42:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,插進來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.53,0:43:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.80,0:43:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,太開心了 太開心了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.62,0:43:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.57,0:44:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥好用力
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.00,0:44:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我還很硬
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.40,0:45:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-太舒服了 -真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.33,0:45:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.23,0:46:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了 高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.56,0:46:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了要高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.22,0:47:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-抱歉 -別道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.27,0:47:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我讓你打起精神了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.40,0:48:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-媽媽 今天晚飯吃什麼\N-打算做咖喱
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.19,0:48:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-我想要吃海鮮\N-沒有那麼好的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.20,0:48:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-是嗎 -還想吃牛油果
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.00,0:48:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,牛油果加上油
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.69,0:48:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-挺不錯的好像\N-你看啊媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.40,0:48:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我的樣子變了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.90,0:48:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-對確 比之前好看了\N-真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.59,0:48:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-我也不知道 -很適合你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.80,0:48:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,這個很好看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.58,0:49:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因為下一年就畢業了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.10,0:49:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以特別拿到新的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.80,0:49:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-太好了吧\N-我真的很喜歡這個裝扮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.30,0:49:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不過學習也要加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.09,0:49:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-我覺得這個最開心了\N-學習也要加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.80,0:49:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-歡迎回來 學習也要加油了\N-我已經明白了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.12,0:49:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.09,0:49:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 今天很晚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.20,0:49:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不會是有什麼事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.44,0:49:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來好像沒精神\N要吃飯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.43,0:50:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧 身體不舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.35,0:50:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.43,0:50:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,究竟怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.70,0:50:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-那麼沒有海鮮嗎\N-沒辦法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.42,0:50:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,其實哥哥有女朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.00,0:50:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.40,0:50:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前問了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.00,0:50:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.10,0:50:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.00,0:51:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.66,0:51:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.30,0:51:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-好像忘記了 -應該是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.68,0:51:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N算了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.50,0:51:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.59,0:51:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N是這樣嗎 還是這邊 忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.10,0:51:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-行不行啊\N-必須要認真點呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.20,0:51:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-我打算努力練習 -的確
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.05,0:51:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不過也要學習哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.50,0:52:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-隨便吧 -不可以隨便吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.50,0:52:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-為什麼啊\N-學習一定要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.70,0:52:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.71,0:52:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.40,0:52:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你在看什麼 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.37,0:52:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.50,0:52:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,比起那些事 你看\N我的制服 換新了哦 可愛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.18,0:52:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥 你這是什麼表情
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.80,0:53:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥難道
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.13,0:53:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,和女朋友發生什麼了嗎\N是吵架了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.55,0:53:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我靜一靜行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.13,0:53:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,需要這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.91,0:53:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 被甩了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.40,0:53:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你太囉嗦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.33,0:53:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吵架是被甩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.36,0:53:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.96,0:53:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.30,0:54:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,為了讓哥哥打起精神\N我有一個好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.71,0:54:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-到哥哥的房間吧 走吧\N-不用了 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.60,0:54:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,讓了讓哥哥打起精神
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.70,0:54:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我會加油的 看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.23,0:54:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥 看這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.30,0:54:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N加油哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.10,0:54:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.10,0:55:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,再來一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.70,0:55:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.00,0:55:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.40,0:55:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.00,0:55:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼繼續吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.21,0:55:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,從哪裡開始好呢\N1 2 3 4
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.20,0:55:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.60,0:55:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.70,0:56:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.80,0:56:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.70,0:56:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N5 6 7 8
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.50,0:56:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N加油 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.40,0:56:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3 4\N加油 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.40,0:56:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,打起精神了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.90,0:56:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.60,0:56:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.90,0:56:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,身體不舒服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.60,0:56:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.10,0:57:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.01,0:57:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的 別在意
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.09,0:57:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,其實
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.50,0:57:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.19,0:57:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥打起精神
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.70,0:57:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.04,0:57:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,忘掉你的女朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.30,0:57:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.40,0:57:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.17,0:58:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你在幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.19,0:58:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.20,0:58:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,為了讓哥哥打起精神
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.80,0:58:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.70,0:58:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.59,0:58:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥的這裡也太精神了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.90,0:58:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.93,0:58:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你在摸哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.62,0:58:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.30,0:58:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.50,0:58:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,想要怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.80,0:58:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-什麼怎麼辦\N-媽媽也看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.60,0:58:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.60,0:58:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行的 -沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.00,0:59:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.30,0:59:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真囉嗦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.00,0:59:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,明明這裡就很精神
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.06,0:59:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,太害羞了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.60,0:59:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.80,0:59:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,原來這麼大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.20,0:59:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.80,0:59:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,看到我的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.60,0:59:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就興奮了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.30,0:59:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,才沒有看
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.59,0:59:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有看也變得那麼大嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.84,0:59:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.16,0:59:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.01,1:00:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-太害羞了 -安靜點
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.73,1:00:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.90,1:00:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽也在啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.10,1:00:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.60,1:00:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.50,1:00:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡真精神
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.40,1:01:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣沒有聲音
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.80,1:01:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,媽媽也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.50,1:01:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不行的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.40,1:02:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.80,1:02:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看了我的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.90,1:02:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.30,1:02:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼興奮的話
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.19,1:02:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.30,1:02:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,很喜歡看屁股嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.40,1:02:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.90,1:02:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不對嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.40,1:02:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但為什麼變得那麼大
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.38,1:02:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,龜頭不可以
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.20,1:02:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,很敏感嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.01,1:03:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不行的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.50,1:03:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.60,1:03:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.09,1:03:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要看我屁股嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.09,1:03:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股嗎
